      "statement": "The upstream subway schema requires the stable identity keys subwayId, updnLine, trainLineNm, and recptnDt to be present and non-empty (a row missing one throws, which the controller maps to 502 UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE), while volatile fields barvlDt, arvlMsg3, lstcarAt are nullable/defaulted so normal variance never throws.",
