      "statement": "fetchSubwayArrivals discards the updatedAt derived from upstream recptnDt and returns a receipt-time updatedAt (new Date().toISOString()); the bus route stamps updatedAt at the controller the same way, because a lagging upstream data timestamp would mark fresh data stale under the 90-second rule and drop imminent trains.",
